    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d234">

                <pb facs="0504" n="484" sameAs="frus:frus1864p2/pg484"/>

                <head>Lord Lyons to Mr.
                        Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-01-13"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 13, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> Her Majesty’s government have been informed
                    that the British brigs Volante, of Jersey, and Dashing Wave, of Liverpool, have
                    been captured by United States cruisers at Matamoras; and her Majesty’s
                    government have directed me to inquire of you on what grounds these vessels,
                    which are stated to have been engaged in a legitimate trade between the United
                    Kingdom and the Mexican port of Matamoras have been thus captured.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with the highest consideration, sir, your most obedient,
                    humble servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>LYONS.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
